OL,3,GNEWSAJulie's murderer is 'evil through
OL,4,Aand through'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who successfully had the double
OL,7,Fjeopardy law changed, leading her
OL,8,Fdaughter's murderer to be jailed for a
OL,9,Fminimum term of 17 years, has said he
OL,10,Fis "evil through and through" and
OL,11,Fshould never be free.
OL,13,FWilliam Dunlop sexually abused and
OL,14,Fstrangled 22-year-old Julie Hogg before
OL,15,Fhiding her body beneath a bath in
OL,16,FBillingham, near Middlesbrough, in
OL,17,F1989.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
