OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1792675561
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAJulie's murderer is 'evil through
OL,4,Aand through'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJulie's son, Kevin Hogg, and mother,
OL,7,FAnn Ming, have been in London observing
OL,8,FDunlop, who was eventually jailed for
OL,9,Flife in 2006, as he makes his fourth
OL,10,Fbid for parole.
OL,12,FDunlop told the Parole Board he was no
OL,13,Flonger the "horrible violent person" he
OL,14,Fhad been and was ready for release, but
OL,15,FAnn said she did not believe him.
